[00:00.00]J.Fla - Shape Of You\r\n[00:00.81]Lyrics by：Briggs/Kevin Jerome/BURRUSS/KANDI L./COTTLE/TAMEKA/MAC/STEVE/MCDAID/JOHN (GB)/SHEERAN/EDWARD CHRISTOPHER\r\n[00:05.45]Composed by：Briggs/Kevin Jerome/BURRUSS/KANDI L./COTTLE/TAMEKA/MAC/STEVE/MCDAID/JOHN (GB)/SHEERAN/EDWARD CHRISTOPHER\r\n[00:10.17]The club isn't the best place to find a lover\r\n[00:12.49]So the bar is where I go\r\n[00:15.21]Me and my friends at the table doing shots\r\n[00:17.51]Drinking fast and then we talk slow\r\n[00:20.13]Come over and start up a conversation with just me\r\n[00:22.70]And trust me I'll give it a chance now\r\n[00:25.01]Take my hand stop\r\n[00:26.11]Put van the man on the jukebox\r\n[00:27.67]And then we start to dance\r\n[00:29.29]And nowI'm singing like\r\n[00:30.30]Do you know I want your love\r\n[00:32.80]Your love was handmade for somebody like me\r\n[00:35.94]Come on now follow my lead\r\n[00:37.79]I may be crazy don't mind me\r\n[00:39.92]Say boy let's not talk too much\r\n[00:42.81]Grab on my waist and put that body on me\r\n[00:45.95]Come on now follow my lead\r\n[00:47.47]Come come on now follow my lead\r\n[00:51.23]I'm in love with the shape of you\r\n[00:53.62]We push and pull like a magnet do\r\n[00:56.08]Although my heart is falling too\r\n[00:58.74]I'm in love with your body\r\n[01:01.20]Last night you were in my room\r\n[01:03.62]And now my bed sheets smell like you\r\n[01:05.69]Every day discovering something brand new\r\n[01:08.74]I'm in love with your body\r\n[01:10.42]Oh I oh I oh I oh I\r\n[01:13.75]I'm in love with your body\r\n[01:15.40]Oh I oh I oh I oh I\r\n[01:18.74]I'm in love with your body\r\n[01:20.41]Oh I oh I oh I oh I\r\n[01:23.72]I'm in love with your body\r\n[01:25.65]Every day discovering something brand new\r\n[01:28.73]I'm in love with the shape of you\r\n[01:30.51]One week in we let the story begin\r\n[01:32.35]We're going out on our first date\r\n[01:34.97]You and me are thrifty\r\n[01:36.22]So go all you can eat\r\n[01:37.34]Fill up your bag and I fill up a plate\r\n[01:39.82]We talk for hours and hours about the sweet and the sour\r\n[01:42.41]And how your family is doing okay\r\n[01:45.01]Leave and get in a taxi then kiss in the back seat\r\n[01:47.50]Tell the driver make the radio play\r\n[01:49.25]AndI'm singing like\r\n[01:50.33]Do you know I want your love\r\n[01:52.81]Your love was handmade for somebody like me\r\n[01:55.94]Come on now follow my lead\r\n[01:57.80]I may be crazy don't mind me\r\n[01:59.92]Say boy let's not talk too much\r\n[02:02.81]Grab on my waist and put that body on me\r\n[02:05.96]Come on now follow my lead\r\n[02:07.47]Come come on now follow my lead\r\n[02:11.23]I'm in love with the shape of you\r\n[02:13.61]We push and pull like a magnet do\r\n[02:16.08]Although my heart is falling too\r\n[02:18.74]I'm in love with your body\r\n[02:21.19]Last night you were in my room\r\n[02:23.61]And now my bed sheets smell like you\r\n[02:25.69]Every day discovering something brand new\r\n[02:28.73]I'm in love with your body\r\n[02:30.41]Oh I oh I oh I oh I\r\n[02:33.74]I'm in love with your body\r\n[02:35.41]Oh I oh I oh I oh I\r\n[02:38.74]I'm in love with your body\r\n[02:40.41]Oh I oh I oh I oh I\r\n[02:43.73]I'm in love with your body\r\n[02:45.65]Every day discovering something brand new\r\n[02:48.75]I'm in love with the shape of you\r\n